 66+  4010              BAKCLR   EQU $F3EA
 67+  4010              BDRCLR   EQU $F3EB
 68+  4010              SCNCNT   EQU $F3F6      ; interrupts left before the BIOS reads the keyboard
 69+  4010              PUTPNT   EQU $F3F8      ; where the next key goes into the key buffer
 70+  4010              GETPNT   EQU $F3FA      ; where CHGET takes the next one from
 71+  4010              NEWKEY   EQU $FBE5      ; the eleven rows, as the BIOS last read them
